<title>USA: TABLE - Emerson Electric Co Q3 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Emerson Electric Co Q3 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended June 30,	 Percent</p>
<p>					 1997     1996	   Increase</p>
<p> Net sales		     $3,208.4 $2,896.8		10.8%</p>
<p>Earnings before income taxes</p>
<p>					471.6    421.8		11.8%</p>
<p> Net earnings		     296.6    266.9		11.1%</p>
<p> Earnings per common share     0.67     0.60		11.7%</p>
<p>			  Nine Months Ended June 30,	  Percent</p>
<p> Net sales			9,142.5  8,282.4		10.4%</p>
<p>Earnings before income taxes</p>
<p>				    1,322.6  1,186.1		11.5%</p>
<p> Net earnings		     831.9    752.3		10.6%</p>
<p> Earnings per common share     1.87     1.68		11.3%</p>
<p>	    (DOLLARS IN MILLIONS EXCEPT PER SHARE AMOUNTS)</p>
<p>		   ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
